 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Inter sanctos Lirinenses refertur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>Bertus pontifex praeclarus, II, 218.</ITEM> <ITEM>Beseleel familiaris Caroli et Alcuini familiaris adjutor,
